Bad example: Quote: ''We pay about 300 bills a month'' -> volume, route to bills_per_period.', '["rent is on autopay", "we key utilities every month", "memorized transactions", "recurring bills"]'::jsonb, '["One-off vendor bills are bill_intake/vendor_payment territory", "this field is the recurring subset. If the prospect doesn''t distinguish, answer the general fields and mark this covered-by reference."]'::jsonb, NULL, 490, true),
(NULL, 'deal', 'ap_approval_process', 'What does the approval process look like?', 'text', 'Bill approval workflow: who approves, thresholds, mechanism (email, system, verbal).', 'Payables, Purchasing & Expenses', 'Bill approval workflow: who approves, thresholds, mechanism (email, system, verbal).', 'Text: approver chain + thresholds + mechanism. Thresholds verbatim.
