(NULL, 'deal', 'bill_intake_method', 'How do vendor bills get into the system?', 'text', 'How bills arrive and get entered: email inbox, paper, OCR capture, vendor portals, manual keying.', 'Payables, Purchasing & Expenses', 'How bills arrive and get entered: email inbox, paper, OCR capture, vendor portals, manual keying.', 'Text: intake channel(s) + entry mechanism.
