(NULL, 'deal', 'bills_per_period', 'How many bills are you processing in a typical period?', 'number', 'Vendor bill volume per month. Canonical home: deal_sizing.ap_invoices_monthly.', 'Payables, Purchasing & Expenses', 'Vendor bill volume per month. Canonical home: deal_sizing.ap_invoices_monthly.', 'Number per month. Weekly x4.33 noted; annual /12 noted. Ranges: midpoint, range in notes.
