(NULL, 'deal', 'bill_capture_tech', 'Are you using any technology to transcribe or capture bills?', 'text', 'Whether OCR/capture tooling exists (Bill.com capture, Dext, Ramp bill pay) or entry is fully manual. Tools write company_systems.', 'Payables, Purchasing & Expenses', 'Whether OCR/capture tooling exists (Bill.com capture, Dext, Ramp bill pay) or entry is fully manual. Tools write company_systems.', 'Text/boolean + tool name. ''None, fully manual'' is a valid recorded answer and a pain marker at volume.
