(NULL, 'deal', 'purchasing_process', 'How does your purchasing process work today?', 'text', 'Pre-spend process: who can buy, how purchases are initiated and approved before the bill arrives.', 'Payables, Purchasing & Expenses', 'Pre-spend process: who can buy, how purchases are initiated and approved before the bill arrives.', 'Text: initiation -> approval -> ordering, as stated.
