(NULL, 'deal', 'inventory_type', 'Do you carry inventory, and if so, what type (buy-to-sell, manufacturing, or supplies)?', 'text', 'GATE for the section. Whether inventory exists on the balance sheet and its nature: buy-to-sell (distribution), manufactured goods, or internal supplies only.', 'Inventory & Manufacturing', 'GATE for the section. Whether inventory exists on the balance sheet and its nature: buy-to-sell (distribution), manufactured goods, or internal supplies only.', 'Enum: none | buy_to_sell | manufacturing | supplies_only | mixed, + description. ''Supplies only'' typically gates the rest of the section OFF.
