Bad example: Quote: ''We keep office supplies in a closet'' -> supplies_only; section gates off.', '["we stock", "we carry inventory", "buy and resell", "we make", "just shop supplies", "no inventory"]'::jsonb, '["Consigned or customer-owned stock is not their inventory", "capture the nuance verbatim. Service companies saying ''truck stock'' may be supplies_only", "clarify via follow-up rather than assuming."]'::jsonb, NULL, 590, true),
(NULL, 'deal', 'inventory_flow', 'Can you walk me through the full process from purchasing raw materials to selling a finished product?', 'text', 'The procure-to-sell narrative: buying, receiving, storage, transformation (if any), fulfillment. Accumulates across quotes like invoicing_process_end_to_end.', 'Inventory & Manufacturing', 'The procure-to-sell narrative: buying, receiving, storage, transformation (if any), fulfillment. Accumulates across quotes like invoicing_process_end_to_end.', 'Text narrative, every step quote-traced; gaps stay gaps.
