Bad example: Inserting ''then presumably QC checks it'' -> fabricated; never write.', '["we buy from", "receive into", "it sits in", "then we build", "ships from"]'::jsonb, '["Never bridge unstated steps. Drop-ship arrangements (never touching stock) are a distinct flow worth capturing verbatim."]'::jsonb, NULL, 600, true),
(NULL, 'deal', 'inventory_tracking_costing', 'How are you tracking and costing inventory today?', 'text', 'Current tracking mechanism (system, spreadsheet, physical-only) and how cost is assigned today (the method itself goes to inventory_costing_method).', 'Inventory & Manufacturing', 'Current tracking mechanism (system, spreadsheet, physical-only) and how cost is assigned today (the method itself goes to inventory_costing_method).', 'Text: tracking tool + process. Tool names write company_systems.
