(NULL, 'deal', 'warehouse_count', 'How many warehouses do you have?', 'number', 'Count of physical stocking locations (warehouses, stocking branches; trucks if they track truck stock as locations). Canonical home: deal_sizing.warehouse_count (new column).', 'Inventory & Manufacturing', 'Count of physical stocking locations (warehouses, stocking branches; trucks if they track truck stock as locations). Canonical home: deal_sizing.warehouse_count (new column).', 'Number. Truck-stock counted only if the prospect frames trucks as stock locations; note the framing.
