Bad example: Quote: ''Twelve offices'' -> locations, not warehouses.', '["N warehouses", "N stocking locations", "main DC plus N branches", "every truck carries stock"]'::jsonb, '["Offices and storefronts without stock are not warehouses. Entity count is unrelated", "never cross-infer."]'::jsonb, 'deal_sizing.warehouse_count', 620, true),
(NULL, 'deal', 'inventory_count_frequency', 'How often are inventory counts performed?', 'text', 'Physical count cadence: annual full count, cycle counts, never.', 'Inventory & Manufacturing', 'Physical count cadence: annual full count, cycle counts, never.', 'Text normalized: annual | quarterly | monthly | cycle_counting | never, + detail.
