Bad example: Quote: ''We really need cycle counting'' -> desired, note as gap.', '["we count once a year", "cycle counts", "full physical at year-end", "haven''t counted since"]'::jsonb, '["''Should count more'' is aspiration. Shrinkage complaints are pain candidates linked here."]'::jsonb, NULL, 630, true),
