(NULL, 'deal', 'inventory_costing_method', 'What costing method do you use?', 'text', 'Inventory costing method: FIFO, LIFO, weighted/moving average, standard, specific identification.', 'Inventory & Manufacturing', 'Inventory costing method: FIFO, LIFO, weighted/moving average, standard, specific identification.', 'Enum normalized to method names; ''don''t know'' is partial with a CFO follow-up task (common answer).
